naan (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changed profile wm bias to 0.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 16:36:00 +0800

naan (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release.
  * Profiles now bind a hash as well as DIV and BIAS: b, w, and dw use
    SHA-256; wm uses SHA-1 with DIV=2000 and BIAS=2000 (2000 through 3999).
  * A later hash, --mod, or --bias option still overrides the matching
    profile field.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 07:45:20 +0800

naan (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Implement naan: print (digest(NAME) mod DIV) + BIAS for each name.
  * Add digest algorithms: MD5, SHA-1/224/256/384/512, SHA3-256/512,
    BLAKE2s, BLAKE2b, RIPEMD-160, CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE, and CRC-32/ISO-HDLC.
  * Add range profiles b, w (default), dw, and wm (2000 through 3999).
  * Translate help and man pages for L3 locales (Tier I–III primaries).
  * Build-depend on libssl-dev and gettext; ship locale catalogs.
  * Skip the MinGW portable build when cross OpenSSL/libcrypto is absent.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 07:37:05 +0800

